Package: statcram
Type: Package
Title: Study Companion for Introductory Statistics with R and UBStats
Version: 0.9.1
Authors@R: person("OpenAI","Prototype",email="noreply@example.com",role=c("aut","cre"))
Description: A study companion for an introductory statistics course taught
    with R and UBStats. A numbered menu (sc()), a point-and-click panel
    (sc_app()) and consistently named functions cover descriptive statistics,
    probability, confidence intervals, hypothesis tests, power and sample
    size, chi-square tests and linear regression. Every procedure accepts raw
    data or the summary numbers given in a question, and prints the formulas
    with the numbers plugged in, the decision, a model answer to compare with
    your own and the UBStats call that produces the result. sc_table()
    rebuilds tables printed on paper as data frames.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), shiny, miniUI, rstudioapi
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
